## Scope

The MIT License above applies to the source code in this repository: everything
under `pipeline/`, `scripts/`, and other `.py`, `.md`, and configuration files
that make up the pipeline and dashboard implementation.

It does NOT extend to non-code media in this repository — generated character
images and video, look/scene reference material, and the contents of
`public_evidence/`. That material is provided for research-viewing and
portfolio-review purposes only. All rights to the depicted synthetic character,
generated imagery, and video content are reserved by the author; it may not be
reused, redistributed, or used to train other models without permission.
